      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么意思？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E48610F601DFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真厉害啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53895BB3554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "先不管你能不能听懂，\n我来解释一下好了。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n使用挥指这种招式后，\n就会出现某一种招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51484E0D7BA14F6080FD4E0D80FD542C61C2FF0C000A6211676589E391CA4E004E0B597D4E86300200100001BE01000A4F7F7528632563078FD979CD62DB5F0F540EFF0C000A5C314F1A51FA73B067D04E0079CD62DB5F0FFF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这种事还是通过体验来理解吧！\n也就是说，和我进行宝可梦对战！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD979CD4E8B8FD8662F901A8FC74F539A8C6765740689E35427FF01000A4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C548C62118FDB884C5B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你准备好和我进行宝可梦对战了，\n就来跟我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6051C65907597D548C62118FDB884C5B9D53EF68A65BF962184E86FF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "挥指后会出现哪种招式呢？\n要来试一试你的运气吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
