      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啧啧啧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "556755675567FF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战输了，但我没有输。\n因为出现了我第一次看到的招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF962188F934E86FF0C4F4662116CA167098F933002000A56E04E3A51FA73B04E8662117B2C4E006B21770B5230768462DB5F0FFF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "通过挥指来刺激大脑，\n就能随机使出多种招式。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n宝可梦拥有无限的可能性！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901A8FC7632563076765523A6FC059278111FF0C000A5C3180FD968F673A4F7F51FA591A79CD62DB5F0F300200100001BE00000A5B9D53EF68A662E5670965E09650768453EF80FD6027FF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是呢……\n好像也有通过挥指无法使出的招式，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n为了找出它，我会继续战斗下去！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我要挥指，挥到引发冲击波的程度！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
