      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F546220262026000A597D50CF4E5F6709901A8FC76325630765E06CD54F7F51FA768462DB5F0FFF0C00100001BE00000A4E3A4E86627E51FA5B83FF0C62114F1A7EE77EED621865974E0B53BBFF0100100001BE00000A6211898163256307FF0C632552305F1553D151B251FB6CE276847A0B5EA6FF0100100002011401500000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
